  "description": {
    "raw": "With this litany, you become more aware of your opponents. You can make two additional attacks of opportunity this round. Furthermore, you gain a +2 sacred bonus to AC against attacks of opportunity.\n\nWhile subject to this spell, the target cannot be the target of another spell that has the word \"litany\" in the title.",
